sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Store Owner
  participant B as Browser (charts.js)
  participant D as Flask Dashboard Blueprint
  participant A as AnalyticsService
  participant DB as MySQL Database

  O->>B: Navigate to /dashboard
  B->>D: GET /dashboard
  D->>A: get_kpis()
  A->>DB: Aggregation queries on sales, sale_items & expenses
  DB-->>A: Summary sums & counts
  A-->>D: kpi_data dictionary
  D-->>B: Render dashboard.html (cards + empty canvas containers)
  par Load Chart Visualizations
    B->>D: GET /api/chart/sales-trend
    D->>DB: 30-day daily sales query
    DB-->>D: Rows
    D-->>B: JSON trend data
    B->>B: Render Chart 1 (Line)
  and Top Products
    B->>D: GET /api/chart/top-products
    D->>DB: Grouped sum on sale_items
    DB-->>D: Rows
    D-->>B: JSON top products
    B->>B: Render Chart 2 (Bar)
  and Forecast
    B->>D: GET /api/chart/forecast
    D->>DB: 28-day historical revenue
    DB-->>D: Daily revenue array
    D-->>B: JSON SMA + seasonality projection
    B->>B: Render Chart 6 (Dotted Line)
  end
  B-->>O: Interactive dashboard rendered
